      },
      "Message": {
        "User": {
          "userId": "eid_9db3abf4",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:24:00",
          "text": "On the 'Competitive Analysis,' we should consider adding a bit more on how we plan to address the 'brand recognition' challenge. Maybe a brief outline of our marketing strategy could be included?",
